#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "&blogilo; is a blogging client."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A blog client (also called blog software or blogware) is software designed "
"to simplify the creation and maintenance of weblogs. As other specialized "
"content management systems do, weblog applications support the authoring, "
"editing, and publishing of blog posts and comments, with special functions "
"for image management, web syndication, and moderation of posts and comments."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &blogilo;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the &blogilo; main window, you can create new posts, modify previous "
"ones, remove them from the server as well as upload media files to the "
"server. You can also save posts locally for later use."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All of these will be available after you configure at least one blog in "
"&blogilo;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Without any configured blog you can write and save posts locally for later "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &blogilo;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main Window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring a blog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Blog management is available in the <guilabel>Configure &blogilo;</guilabel> "
"dialog, and is accessible via the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &blogilo;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu, "
"or alternatively via the <menuchoice><guimenu>Blog</guimenu><guimenuitem>Add "
"Blog...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Add a new blog - <guilabel>Basic</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Add a new blog - <guilabel>Basic</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a blog, you simply have to insert your blog address, username and "
"password in the corresponding fields and then click the <guibutton>Auto "
"Configure</guibutton> button for the most popular blogging servers, such as "
"Wordpress. It will guess your blog, and api, and then will fetch your Blog "
"Id."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If it fails, you can manually select your blog's API type in the "
"<guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab and click <guibutton>Fetch ID</guibutton> "
"to fetch your Blog Id, or enter your Blog Id if you know it. And if you are "
"using a “right to left” language, select <guilabel>Right To Left</guilabel> "
"in next drop-down list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Add a new blog - <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Add a new blog - <guilabel>Advanced</guilabel> tab</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can check what &blogilo; supports for your blog in the "
"<guilabel>Supported Features</guilabel> tab."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new Post"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new post, in the main window, you can click on <guibutton>New "
"Post</guibutton> toolbar button or under the <guimenu>Post</guimenu> menu, "
"or simply press <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></"
"keycombo> (its shortcut)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new/empty post is created, and you can write, and configure it, and then "
"submit it to your blog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &blogilo; main window is divided into two sections, Composer and Toolbox."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Composer"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the Composer section, you have a text field with the label "
"<guilabel>Title</guilabel>, where you can write the title of the post. Below "
"it, you have three tabs to edit your post in several ways. The first is a "
"Visual Editor: it is a WYSIWYG editor and you only need to use the icons to "
"format your text. The next tab is an &HTML; editor, where you have a syntax "
"highlighted text editor to edit the &HTML; code of your post. And on the "
"last tab, you can preview your post with your blog style, before submitting "
"it to the server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toolbox"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Toolbox has four sections:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Blog Posts</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Blog Posts</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Blog Posts</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "In this section, you can fetch the latest posts from the server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Double click on a post entry to load it into the composer and modify it, or "
"select a post and use the relevant button to remove it from the server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Post Categories</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Post Categories</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Post Categories</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this section you can select categories and tags for your post. Tags must "
"be comma separated."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Post Options</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Post Options</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Post Options</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can select options for the currently active post in the composer "
"such as <guilabel>Feedback</guilabel> options (for example, if visitors can "
"leave a comment for this post or not), select a publish date, or a title to "
"use for a permalink of the post (for Wordpress blogs only)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Local Entries</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:210
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Local Entries</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Local Entries</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"And in the <guilabel>Local Entries</guilabel> section, you can double click "
"on an entry to load it into the composer, or you can remove it from disk."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Uploading a Media file to the server"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To upload a file to the server, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Blog</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Upload Media...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. You are then asked "
"to select a file from your disk. The media upload dialog will be displayed:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Upload Media</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Upload Media</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your blog API supports media uploading, you have 2 options here, and if "
"not, there is just one and it's &FTP; server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can preview your desired file here (if preview method available), and "
"enter its name on the server. And then click <guibutton>Upload</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to upload to an &FTP; server, the absolute path of the folder is "
"required. And you have to enter a &URL; to use for identifying the link of "
"the file on the server."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Reference"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
